Here is a function that finds the median of three measurements. What does Serial.println(medyan3(30, 400, 28)); print?

```
int medyan3(int a, int b, int c) {
  if (a > b) { int t = a; a = b; b = t; }
  if (b > c) { int t = b; b = c; c = t; }
  if (a > b) { int t = a; a = b; b = t; }
  return b;
}
```

